    "type": "WSI",
    "diagnosis": "<p>GAPPS: Hyperproliferative aberrant pits (HPAPs)</p>",
    "title": "",
    "legend": "<p>Whole mount of gastric polyposis showing a number of hyperproliferative aberrant pits (HPAPs), some showing mild fundic gland polyp-like changes</p>",
